    "basic": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Wild Spear"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Leeho deals Physical DMG by stabbing and slashing enemies with his spear. / Holding the Basic Attack button will make Leeho throw his spear at an enemy, dealing Fire DMG. Holding the Basic Attack button for longer will make Leeho throw a more powerful Flash Spear, piercing and dealing Fire DMG to all enemies in front of him. / If the enemy he targets has Prey Mark, Flash Spear does not need time to charge. When DMG is dealt to an enemy with Prey Mark using Flash Spear, Prey Mark is removed and Leeho is granted Tiger Hunter. / Tiger Hunter: Increases Basic Attack DMG. Also, Leeho's Basic Attack is enhanced during the effect's duration, dealing powerful Fire DMG. If Tiger Hunter ends during an Enhanced Basic Attack, Leeho strikes the ground in front of him, dealing Fire DMG. If an Evasion Counter is successfully used within the duration of Tiger Hunter, its duration is reset."
      },
